# --- Vendored SDK documentation clones (fetched, never committed) ---
# These are re-cloned fresh via scripts/fetch-docs.sh so the repo always points
# at the actual upstream source instead of a stale copy. See docs/sources/README.md.
docs/sources/adk-python/
docs/sources/openai-agents-python/
docs/sources/claude-agent-sdk-python/

# --- Assessment source data (real client documents + vendor proprietary IP) ---
# Real client plan documents, manual review write-ups, and licensed reference
# material (ASA guide/template/troubling-provisions). Never committed — this
# repo is public. Only our own authored business-requirements docs
# (assessments/*/README.md, cross-cutting-business-rules.md) are tracked.
docs/usecase/assessments/*/data/

